Package: swayimg
Version: @DEB_SWAYIMG_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/artemsen/swayimg
Depends: libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, luajit, libpng16-16, libjpeg62-turbo
Description: Lightweight Wayland image viewer
 swayimg is a configurable image viewer for Wayland. This iOS build enables
 the Wayland UI, Lua configuration, built-in formats, PNG, and JPEG while
 disabling DRM and heavier optional image codec stacks.
